# Service interface to convert a quaternion to Euler angles (roll, pitch, yaw).

# Request: X component of the input quaternion
float64 x
# Request: Y component of the input quaternion
float64 y
# Request: Z component of the input quaternion
float64 z
# Request: W component of the input quaternion
float64 w  
---
# Response: Rotation around X-axis (roll) in radians
float64 roll
# Response: Rotation around Y-axis (pitch) in radians
float64 pitch
# Response: Rotation around Z-axis (yaw) in radians
float64 yaw